      </selectionEntries>
      <selectionEntryGroups>
        <selectionEntryGroup name="Hexagrammaton Wing" hidden="false" id="da-wing-hs-vindicator" collective="false" import="true">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="da-wing-hs-vindicator-min" field="selections" scope="parent" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="min" />
            <constraint id="da-wing-hs-vindicator-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
          </constraints>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden">
              <conditions>
                <condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="legion-i" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" />
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
            <modifier type="set" value="1" field="da-wing-hs-vindicator-min">
              <conditions>
                <condition type="atLeast" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="legion-i" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" />
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <selectionEntries>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Stormwing" hidden="false" id="da-wing-hs-vindicator-0">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="da-wing-hs-vindicator-0-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Stormwing" id="da-wing-hs-vindicator-0-rule" hidden="false">
                  <description>First Fire/Overwatch: re-roll To Hit rolls of 1 with Bolters, Bolt Pistols, Storm Bolters, Foeblaster Boltguns and bolter component of combi-weapons. If The Storm of War is selected: stationary Stormwing units also use the Stormwing re-roll during the normal Shooting phase; Stormwing Infantry containing a Stormwing Character gains Stubborn.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Deathwing" hidden="false" id="da-wing-hs-vindicator-1">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="da-wing-hs-vindicator-1-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Deathwing" id="da-wing-hs-vindicator-1-rule" hidden="false">
                  <description>With a sword-type weapon against an enemy whose Weapon Skill is higher than the model’s own, re-roll To Hit rolls of 1 in close combat. If The Unbroken Vow is selected: a Deathwing unit within 6" of an Objective gains Feel No Pain (6+), or improves existing Feel No Pain by one step to a maximum of 4+; a Deathwing Independent Character within 12" of an Objective gains +1 Attack.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Dreadwing" hidden="false" id="da-wing-hs-vindicator-2">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="da-wing-hs-vindicator-2-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Dreadwing" id="da-wing-hs-vindicator-2-rule" hidden="false">
                  <description>Flame, Plasma and Volkite attacks against this unit are -1 Strength (minimum 1); against Dreadwing Vehicles/Dreadnoughts this also reduces Armour Penetration Strength. If The Eskaton Imperative is selected: Dreadwing Infantry gain Move Through Cover and all Dreadwing models may re-roll failed Dangerous Terrain tests.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Ironwing" hidden="false" id="da-wing-hs-vindicator-3">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="da-wing-hs-vindicator-3-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Ironwing" id="da-wing-hs-vindicator-3-rule" hidden="false">
                  <description>Re-roll Armour Penetration rolls of 1 against enemy Vehicles. Ironwing Vehicles firing Snap Shots hit on 5+ instead of 6+. If The Steel Fist is selected: a Transport Vehicle carrying an Ironwing Independent Character gains a 6+ Invulnerable Save against shooting, or improves an existing Invulnerable Save by one step to a maximum of 4+.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Firewing" hidden="false" id="da-wing-hs-vindicator-4">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="da-wing-hs-vindicator-4-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Firewing" id="da-wing-hs-vindicator-4-rule" hidden="false">
                  <description>Re-roll To Hit rolls of 1 when attacking an enemy unit containing an Independent Character, in shooting and close combat. If The Serpent’s Bane is selected: against a nominated Priority Target, Firewing models re-roll To Hit rolls of 1 and To Wound rolls of 1 (Armour Penetration rolls of 1 against Vehicles); a Firewing Independent Character gains +1 Attack in melee with a Priority Target. Up to three Firewing Troops units may select Forward Deployment — Infiltrate.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Ravenwing" hidden="false" id="da-wing-hs-vindicator-5">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="da-wing-hs-vindicator-5-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Ravenwing" id="da-wing-hs-vindicator-5-rule" hidden="false">
                  <description>Dark Angels Bikes and Jetbikes gain Skilled Rider; Dark Angels Land Speeders gain Jink. If The Seeker’s Arrow is selected: Ravenwing Infantry, Bikes and Jetbikes gain Outflank; Ravenwing Bikes and Jetbikes gain Hit &amp; Run. At the start of each Dark Angels turn choose +2" Turbo-Boost/Advance, +2" Charge, or +2" Consolidation for all Ravenwing units until the next Dark Angels turn.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
            </selectionEntry>
          </selectionEntries>
        </selectionEntryGroup>
        <selectionEntryGroup id="r40-da-ammo-hs-vindicator" name="Dark Angels Armoury — Ammunition" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true">
          <entryLinks>
            <entryLink id="r40-da-ammo-hs-vindicator-hs-vind-p6" name="Molecular Acid Shells (for Heavy Bolter)" type="selectionEntry" targetId="da22-acid-hb" hidden="true" import="true">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="r40-da-ammo-hs-vindicator-hs-vind-p6-max" type="max" value="3" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
              </constraints>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="7" />
              </costs>
              <modifiers>
                <modifier type="set" value="false" field="hidden">
                  <conditionGroups>
                    <conditionGroup type="and">
                      <conditions>
                        <condition type="atLeast" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="legion-i" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" />
                        <condition type="atLeast" value="1" field="selections" scope="root-entry" childId="hs-vind-p6" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" />
                      </conditions>
                    </conditionGroup>
                  </conditionGroups>
                </modifier>
              </modifiers>
            </entryLink>
          </entryLinks>
        </selectionEntryGroup>
        <selectionEntryGroup id="r49-legion-upgrades-hs-vindicator" name="Legion Wargear &amp; Upgrades" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true">
          <entryLinks>
