                  <description>0–1 White Scars Praetor. Place or move the marker at the start of each White Scars turn. White Scars Infantry attacking an enemy within 6 inches may re-roll shooting To Hit rolls of 1 and increases charge distance against that enemy from 6 to 7 inches.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
            </selectionEntry>
