            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Stormseer Consul" hidden="false" id="r25-consul-v-stormseer-consul">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="r25-consul-v-stormseer-consul-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
              </constraints>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="35" />
              </costs>
              <modifiers>
                <modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="legion-v" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" />
                  </conditions>
                </modifier>
              </modifiers>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Stormseer Consul" id="r25-consul-v-stormseer-consul-rule" hidden="false">
                  <description>A White Scars Legion Centurion may be upgraded to a Stormseer Consul for +35 points. A White Scars army may not select the normal Legion Librarian Consul upgrade. It uses the Stormseer Consul instead.
Wargear:
• Replace the Centurion's Chainsword with a Force Weapon
Special Rules:
• Psyker (Mastery Level 1\)
• Adamantium Will
• Legion Support Officer
PSYCHIC POWERS
A Stormseer knows the Unseen Bolt psychic power.
Unseen Bolt | 36" | 6 | 4 | Assault 1, Blast, Pinning
UNSEEN BOLT
Unseen Bolt is a psychic shooting power. It is used during the Stormseer's Shooting phase instead of firing another weapon.
Take a Psychic test using the normal ProHammer psychic rules. If successful, resolve the attack using the profile above. Unseen Bolt may not be invoked during Return Fire, Overwatch or Stand &amp; Shoot.
Epistolary
A Stormseer may be upgraded to Mastery Level 2 for a further +25 points.
If upgraded to Mastery Level 2, he may select one additional psychic power from the normal Legion Librarian Psychic Powers list.
OPTIONS
• A Stormseer may purchase:
• Psychic Hood .................................. +25 points
All other equipment is selected normally from the Space Marine Armoury.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink id="r80-ih-consul-cat-189" name="Head of the Gorgon — non-Forge-Lord Consul" hidden="false" targetId="r80-ih-head-nonforge-consul" primary="false" />
                <categoryLink id="r81-ih-consul-cat-11" name="Head of the Gorgon — non-Forge Consul" hidden="true" targetId="r81-ih-nonforge-consul" primary="false" />
              </categoryLinks>
            </selectionEntry>
