        <rule id="r57-iw-tyrant-rule-1" name="Coordinated Bombardment" hidden="false">
          <description>When the squad fires its Cyclone Missile Launchers, it may re-roll one failed To Hit roll made with a Cyclone Missile Launcher during that Shooting phase. A model equipped with a Cyclone Missile Launcher may fire it in addition to its Storm bolter or Foeblaster boltgun in the same Shooting phase; both weapons must target the same enemy unit.</description>
        </rule>
