                              <description>The Proteus gains Scout. At the start of the controlling player’s turn before Reserve rolls, choose Disruption Mode (opponent suffers -1 to all Reserve rolls) or Relay Mode (controlling player may re-roll failed Reserve rolls) until the next controlling turn. Multiple webs give no additional benefit and only one mode may be active for the army. A Proteus with the Web has Transport Capacity 8.</description>
