        <rule id="r63-sw-ohthere-winds" name="Mystic Winds of Fenris" hidden="false">
          <description>Blessing — Ohthere or one friendly Space Wolves unit with at least one model within 6 inches. On a successful Psychic Test, the nominated unit receives a 5+ Cover Save until the beginning of the next Space Wolves turn; improve an existing Cover Save by 1, to a maximum of 4+.</description>
