                <rule id="r71-nl-sev-ret-2-r71-nl-atramentar-rule-3" name="Teleport Assault" hidden="false">
                  <description>An Atramentar Flay-Clade may deploy using Deep Strike even if the mission does not normally permit Deep Strike. All other normal ProHammer Deep Strike rules apply.</description>
