                          <description>Quad Launcher with Frag and Shatter Shells; two Twin-linked Multi-Meltas; Extra Armour; Armoured Ceramite; Searchlight and Smoke Launchers. Power of the Machine Spirit; Transport Capacity 6.</description>
                        </rule>
                        <rule name="Ferromantic Invulnerability" id="r71-nl-curze-ret-3-r71-nl-terror-transport-hs-lr-achilles-hs-lr-achilles-ferromantic-invulnerability" hidden="false">
