                  <description>A Sanguinary Guard Squad may only be selected as the retinue of a Blood Angels Praetor, Raldoron or Sanguinius. It occupies no separate Force Organisation slot. The character must begin the battle joined to the Sanguinary Guard but may leave normally later.</description>
