d-eaters" name="Legiones Astartes (World Eaters)" type="upgrade" hidden="false" import="true" defaultAmount="1"><costs><cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="0" /></costs><constraints><constraint id="r89-we-kharn-special-rules-0-legiones-astartes-world-eaters-min" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /><constraint id="r89-we-kharn-special-rules-0-legiones-astartes-world-eaters-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><rules><rule id="r89-we-kharn-special-rules-0-legiones-astartes-world-eaters-rule" name="Legiones Astartes (World Eaters)" hidden="false"><description>Uses the World Eaters Legion special rule.</description></rule></rules></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="r89-we-kharn-special-rules-1-independent-character" name="Independent Character" type="upgrade" hidden="false" import="true" defaultAmount="1"><costs><cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="0" /></costs><constraints><constraint id="r89-we-kharn-special-rules-1-independent-character-min" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /><constraint id="r89-we-kharn-special-rules-1-independent-character-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><rules><rule id="r89-we-kharn-special-rules-1-independent-character-rule" name="Independent Character" hidden="false"><description>Uses the normal Independent Character rules.</description></rule></rules></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="r89-we-kharn-special-rules-2-master-of-the-legion" name="Master of the Legion" type="upgrade" hidden="false" import="true" defaultAmount="1"><costs><cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="0" /></costs><constraints><constraint id="r89-we-kharn-special-rules-2-master-of-the-legion-min" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /><constraint id="r89-we-kharn-special-rules-2-master-of-the-legion-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><rules><rule id="r89-we-kharn-special-rules-2-master-of-the-legion-rule" name="Master of the Legion" hidden="false"><description>Uses the normal Master of the Legion rule.</description></rule></rules></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="r89-we-kharn-special-rules-3-the-bloody" name="The Bloody" type="upgrade" hidden="false" import="true" defaultAmount="1"><costs><cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="0" /></costs><constraints><constraint id="r89-we-kharn-special-rules-3-the-bloody-min" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /><constraint id="r89-we-kharn-special-rules-3-the-bloody-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><rules><rule id="r89-we-kharn-special-rules-3-the-bloody-rule" name="The Bloody" hidden="false"><description>Whenever Khârn rolls a natural 1 To Hit in close combat, that attack instead hits the nearest friendly model within 6 inches. If several friendly models are equally close, the opposing player chooses which is hit. Resolve the hit using Khârn’s current Strength and the weapon being used. The friendly model may take any saves normally permitted. Wounds caused in this manner do not count towards the close-combat result. If no friendly model is within 6 inches, the roll of 1 is a miss.</description></rule></rules></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="r89-we-kharn-special-rules-4-command-retinue" name="Command Retinue" type="upgrade" hidden="false" import="true" defaultAmount="1"><costs><cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="0" /></costs><constraints><constraint id="r89-we-kharn-special-rules-4-command-retinue-min" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /><constraint id="r89-we-kharn-special-rules-4-command-retinue-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><rules><rule id="r89-we-kharn-special-rules-4-command-retinue-rule" name="Command Retinue" hidden="false"><description>Khârn may select one Legion Command Squad or Rampager Squad as his retinue. The selected unit does not occupy a separate Force Organisation slot.</description></rule></rules></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntryGroup><selectionEntryGroup id="r89-we-kharn-options" name="Options" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="r89-we-kharn-opt-0-krak-grenades" name="Krak grenades" type="upgrade" hidden="false" import="true"><costs><cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="2" /></costs><constraints><constraint id="r89-we-kharn-opt-0-krak-grenades-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="r89-we-kharn-opt-1-jump-pack" name="Jump Pack" type="upgrade" hidden="false" import="true"><costs><cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="20" /></costs><constraints><constraint id="r89-we-kharn-opt-1-jump-pack-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><rules><rule id="r89-we-kharn-opt-1-jump-pack-rule" name="Jump Pack" hidden="false"><description>Changes Khârn to Jump Infantry while equipped.</description></rule></rules></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntryGroup><selectionEntryGroup id="live-r3-we-r41-unit-xii-6-kharn-the-bloody-retinue" name="RETINUE — choose up to one (no separate FOC slot)" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><constraints><constraint id="live-r3-we-r41-unit-xii-6-kharn-the-bloody-retinue-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><selectionEntries><selectionEntry type="unit" name="Legion Command Squad" id="live-r3-we-r41-unit-xii-6-kharn-the-bloody-retinue-0-hq-centurion-ret-command" hidden="false" import="true">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="live-r3-we-r41-unit-xii-6-kharn-the-bloody-retinue-0-hq-centurion-ret-command-ret-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="90" />
              </costs>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Standard Wargear" id="live-r3-we-r41-unit-xii-6-kharn-the-bloody-retinue-0-hq-centurion-ret-command-std" hidden="false">
                  <description>Five Legion Veterans, each equipped with Power Armour, Bolt Pistol, Chainsword and Frag Grenades.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="Legiones Astartes" id="live-r3-we-r41-unit-xii-6-kharn-the-bloody-retinue-0-hq-centurion-ret-command-la" hidden="false">
                  <description>Every model has Legiones Astartes and And They Shall Know No Fear as presented in ProHammer Classic, and is not Fearless.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="Retinue" id="live-r3-we-r41-unit-xii-6-kharn-the-bloody-retinue-0-hq-centurion-ret-command-ret" hidden="false">
                  <description>May only be selected for an eligible HQ character. It occupies no separate Force Organisation slot; character and Command Squad count as one HQ choice but may deploy and operate separately.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <selectionEntries>
                <selectionEntry type="model" name="Legion Veterans" id="live-r3-we-r41-unit-xii-6-kharn-the-bloody-retinue-0-hq-centurion-ret-command-vets" hidden="false" import="true" defaultAmount="5">
