      </constraints>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Titus Prayto" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xiii-8-titus-prayto-profile-0">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">10</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">2+/5+</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xiii-8-titus-prayto-source" hidden="false">
          <description>Titus Prayto | 5 | 5 | 4 | 4 | 3 | 5 | 3 | 10 | 2+/5+
Force Organisation:
PSYCHIC POWERS Titus Prayto selects two psychic powers from the normal Psychic Power list. He follows all normal ProHammer rules for Psykers, Mastery Level 2 and Disturbance in the Warp. PSYCHIC SAVANT Once during each Ultramarines player turn, Prayto may re-roll one failed Psychic Test. The second result must be accepted. COMMAND RETINUE Prayto may select one Legion Command Squad as his retinue. The squad does not occupy a separate Force Organisation slot.
• HQ
Unit Type:
• Infantry (Character)
Wargear:
• Artificer Armour
• Refractor Field
• Force Weapon
• Psychic Hood
• Bolt pistol
• Frag grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Ultramarines)
• Independent Character
• Psyker (Mastery Level 2\)
• Legion Support Officer
• Psychic Savant
OPTIONS
• Titus Prayto may take:
• Krak grenades ................................... +2 points</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <selectionEntryGroups>
        <selectionEntryGroup name="Options" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xiii-8-titus-prayto-options" collective="false" import="true">
          <selectionEntries>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Krak grenades" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xiii-8-titus-prayto-opt-0-krak-grenades">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="r41-unit-xiii-8-titus-prayto-opt-0-krak-grenades-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
              </constraints>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="2" />
              </costs>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Option restriction" id="r41-unit-xiii-8-titus-prayto-opt-0-context" hidden="false">
                  <description>• Titus Prayto may take:</description>
