    <selectionEntry type="unit" import="true" name="PHOSIS T'KAR" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xv-7-phosis-t-kar">
      <costs>
        <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="205" />
      </costs>
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink id="r41-unit-xv-7-phosis-t-kar-cat" name="HQ" hidden="false" targetId="cat-hq" primary="true" />
      </categoryLinks>
      <modifiers>
        <modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden">
          <conditions>
            <condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="legion-xv" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" />
          </conditions>
        </modifier>
      </modifiers>
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="r41-unit-xv-7-phosis-t-kar-unique" field="selections" scope="roster" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
      </constraints>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Phosis T'Kar" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xv-7-phosis-t-kar-profile-0">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">2</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">10</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">3+/4+</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xv-7-phosis-t-kar-source" hidden="false">
          <description>Phosis T'Kar | 5 | 5 | 4 | 4 | 2 | 5 | 3 | 10 | 3+/4+
Force Organisation:
• HQ
Unit Type:
• Infantry (Character)
Wargear:
• Power Armour
• Eldritch Force Field
• Prosperine Force Weapon
• Bolter
• Frag grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Thousand Sons)
• Independent Character
• Master of the Legion
• Psyker (Mastery Level 2\)
• Raptora
• Magister of the Raptora
OPTIONS
• Phosis may take:
• Krak grenades .................................. +2 points
RAPTORA Phosis always belongs to the Raptora and may not select another Prosperine Cult. He receives both the Raptora Cult Arcana and Cult Mastery benefits. MAGISTER OF THE RAPTORA Phosis selects both of his psychic powers from the ProHammer Telekinesis discipline. He otherwise follows all normal ProHammer rules for a Mastery Level 2 Psyker. ELDRITCH FORCE FIELD Phosis has a 4+ Invulnerable Save. Against shooting attacks, this is improved to a 3+ Invulnerable Save. While Phosis is joined to a friendly Thousand Sons Infantry unit, models in that unit receive a 5+ Invulnerable Save against both shooting and close-combat attacks. If a model already possesses an Invulnerable Save, improve it by one instead. An Invulnerable Save improved by this rule may never become better than: • 3+ against shooting attacks; • 4+ against close-combat attacks. This rule may combine with the normal Raptora Cult benefits, but the limits above may never be exceeded. COMMAND RETINUE Phosis may select one Legion Command Squad as his retinue. The squad does not occupy a separate Force Organisation slot.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
