      </constraints>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Magistus Amon" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xv-8-magistus-amon-the-hidden-profile-0">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">2</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">10</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">2+</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xv-8-magistus-amon-the-hidden-source" hidden="false">
          <description>Magistus Amon | 5 | 5 | 4 | 4 | 2 | 5 | 3 | 10 | 2+
Force Organisation:
• HQUnit Type:
• Infantry (Character)
Wargear:
• Armour of Shades
• Prosperine Force Weapon
• Bolt pistol
• Frag grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Thousand Sons)
• Independent Character
• Master of the Legion
• Psyker (Mastery Level 2\)
• Athanaeans
• The Hidden One
RESTRICTION
Amon may only be included in a Thousand Sons army of 1,500 points or more.
OPTIONS
• Amon may take:
• Krak grenades .................................. +2 points
ATHANAEANS Amon always belongs to the Athanaeans and may not select another Prosperine Cult. He receives both the Athanaean Cult Arcana and Cult Mastery benefits. PSYCHIC POWERS Amon selects both of his psychic powers from the ProHammer Telepathy discipline. ARMOUR OF SHADES The Armour of Shades grants Amon a 2+ Armour Save. Amon receives a 5+ Cover Save even while in open ground. If Amon would normally receive a Cover Save from terrain or another rule, improve that Cover Save by two steps, to a maximum of 3+. THE HIDDEN ONE While Amon is joined to a friendly Thousand Sons Infantry unit, that unit receives the same protection as his Armour of Shades: • it receives a 5+ Cover Save while in open ground; • any existing Cover Save is improved by two steps, to a maximum of 3+. Amon and any Infantry unit he has joined also gain Infiltrate. This rule may not be conferred to: • models wearing any form of Terminator Armour; • Bikes; • Jetbikes; • Jump Infantry. MASTER OF THE HIDDEN ORDERS Instead of selecting a normal Legion Command Squad, Amon may select one of the following as his personal retinue: • Ammitara Occult Intercession Cabal • Legion Seeker Squad The selected unit does not occupy a separate Force Organisation slot. Amon and the selected unit count as a single HQ selection.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
