      <rules>
        <rule name="Source Entry" id="live-r2-r41-unit-xv-10-sanakht-retinue-0-r41-unit-xv-1-khenetai-occult-blade-cabal-source" hidden="false">
          <description>Khenetai Blade | 5 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 3 | 9 | 3+
Khenetai Blademaster | 5 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 5 | 4 | 10 | 3+
PSYCHIC BROTHERHOOD When the army is selected, assign the Cabal to one Prosperine Cult. The Cabal receives both the Cult Arcana and Cult Mastery benefits of that Cult. Unlike most Thousand Sons Psychic Brotherhoods, the Khenetai do not select a psychic power from the normal ProHammer Psychic Disciplines. They know only Mindsong of Blades. MINDSong OF BLADES Mindsong of Blades is a Blessing invoked at the beginning of an Assault phase. If successfully invoked, until the end of that Assault phase: • models in the Psyker's unit gain +1 Initiative; • models in the unit may re-roll close-combat To Hit rolls of 1. PAIRED PROSPERINE FORCE BLADES The Khenetai Blades count as a pair of Prosperine Force Weapons. The bonus Attack for fighting with two close-combat weapons is already included in the models' profiles.
Force Organisation:
• Elites
• 0–1
Unit Composition:
• 5 Khenetai Blades
Unit Type:
• Infantry
• The Khenetai Blademaster is a Character
Wargear:
• Power Armour
• Paired Prosperine Force Blades
• Frag grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Thousand Sons)
• Brotherhood of Psykers (Mastery Level 1\)
• Mindsong of Blades
OPTIONS
• The Cabal may include up to five additional Khenetai Blades for +38 points per model.
• One Khenetai Blade may be upgraded to:
• Khenetai Blademaster ....................... +15 points
• For every five models in the Cabal, one Khenetai may take:
• Hand Flamer .................................. +5 points
• Plasma Pistol ............................... +15 points
• The entire Cabal may take:
• Krak grenades .......................... +2 points per model
• Melta bombs ............................ +5 points per model
KHENETAI BLADEMASTER
The Blademaster may select up to 50 points of permitted weapons and wargear from the Space Marine Armoury. He may not replace his Paired Prosperine Force Blades.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
