          <description>Traitor Only
Luperci | 4 | 4 | 5 | 4 | 2 | 4 | 2 | 9 | 3+/5+
Luperci Chieftain | 4 | 4 | 5 | 4 | 2 | 4 | 3 | 9 | 3+/5+
Force Organisation:
DAEMONIC TALONS Daemonic Talons are Rending Weapons. DAMNED A Luperci Pack may never count as a Scoring Unit. No Independent Character may join a Luperci Pack unless that Character has the Daemon special rule.
• Elites
• 0–1
Restriction:
• Traitor armies only
Unit Composition:
• 4 Luperci
• 1 Luperci Chieftain
Unit Type:
• Infantry
• The Luperci Chieftain is a Character
Wargear:
• Power Armour
• Bolt pistol
• Daemonic Talons
• Frag grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Sons of Horus)
• Daemon
• Fearless
• Bulky
• Furious Charge
• Damned
OPTIONS
• The pack may include up to five additional Luperci for +25 points per model.
• For every five models, one Luperci may replace his Bolt pistol with:
• Flamer .......................................... +5 points
• Meltagun ....................................... +10 points
• Plasma Gun ..................................... +15 points</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
