    <selectionEntry type="unit" import="true" name="HORUS AXIMAND, “LITTLE HORUS”" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xvi-5-horus-aximand-little-horus">
      <costs>
        <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="175" />
      </costs>
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink id="r41-unit-xvi-5-horus-aximand-little-horus-cat" name="HQ" hidden="false" targetId="cat-hq" primary="true" />
      </categoryLinks>
      <modifiers>
        <modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden">
          <conditions>
            <condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="legion-xvi" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" />
          </conditions>
        </modifier>
        <modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden">
          <conditions>
            <condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="allegiance-traitor" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" />
          </conditions>
        </modifier>
      </modifiers>
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="r41-unit-xvi-5-horus-aximand-little-horus-unique" field="selections" scope="roster" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
      </constraints>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Horus Aximand" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xvi-5-horus-aximand-little-horus-profile-0">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">6</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">10</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">2+/5+</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xvi-5-horus-aximand-little-horus-source" hidden="false">
          <description>Horus Aximand | 6 | 5 | 4 | 4 | 3 | 5 | 3 | 10 | 2+/5+
MOURN-IT-ALL Mourn-it-All is a Master-crafted Power Weapon. A natural To Wound roll of 6 made with Mourn-it-All inflicts a Massive Wound (D3) instead of a normal Wound. STRATEGIST Add +1 to Reserve rolls made by a Sons of Horus army containing Horus Aximand. COMMAND RETINUE Aximand may select one Legion Command Squad or Chieftain Squad as his retinue. The selected unit does not occupy a separate Force Organisation slot.
Force Organisation:
• HQ
Unit Type:
• Infantry (Character)
Wargear:
• Artificer Armour
• Combat Shield
