      <rules>
        <rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xvi-10-falkus-kibre-source" hidden="false">
          <description>Falkus Kibre | 5 | 5 | 4 | 4 | 2 | 4 | 3 | 9 | 2+/4+
One Justaerin Terminator may be upgraded to Falkus Kibre for +28 points. Falkus therefore has a total cost of 85 points. Falkus: • remains part of the Justaerin Terminator Squad; • is a Character; • is not an Independent Character; • occupies no separate Force Organisation selection. Wargear: • Cataphractii Terminator Armour • The normal weapons carried by the Justaerin he replaces OPTIONS Falkus may select any normal Justaerin weapon replacement, paying the listed cost. He may not select a Heavy weapon. Special Rules: • Legiones Astartes (Sons of Horus) • Justaerin Primus JUSTAERIN PRIMUS While Falkus Kibre remains alive, his Justaerin Terminator Squad has the Fearless special rule. In addition, the squad may purchase the Furious Charge Veteran Skill for +4 points per model.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
    </selectionEntry>
