        <rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xvii-2-ashen-circle-source" hidden="false">
          <description>Incendiary | 5 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 2 | 9 | 3+
Iconoclast | 5 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 3 | 10 | 3+
Force Organisation:
AXE-RAKE An Axe-rake is a close-combat weapon. Attacks made with an Axe-rake are resolved at +1 Strength. If an enemy unit Retreats from a close combat involving one or more models armed with Axe-rakes, reduce its Retreat distance by 1", to a minimum of 1". BITTER DUTY Only an Independent Character specifically permitted to join Bitter Duty units may join an Ashen Circle Squad.
• Fast Attack
Unit Composition:
• 4 Incendiaries
• 1 Iconoclast
Unit Type:
• Jump Infantry
• The Iconoclast is a Character
Wargear:
• Hardened Power Armour
• Jump Pack
• Hand Flamer
• Axe-rake
• Frag grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Word Bearers)
• Hardened Armour
• Bitter Duty
OPTIONS
• The squad may include up to five additional Incendiaries for +25 points per model.
• Any model may replace his Axe-rake with:
• Rending Weapon ................................ +5 points
• Power weapon ................................. +10 points
• The entire squad may take:
• Krak grenades ............................ +2 points per model
• Melta bombs .............................. +5 points per model
ICONOCLAST
The Iconoclast may replace his Hand Flamer with:
• Plasma pistol ................................... +15 points
The Iconoclast may take:
• Artificer Armour ............................... +10 points</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
