      <rules>
        <rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xvii-5-possessed-marine-squad-source" hidden="false">
          <description>Possessed Marine | 4 | 4 | 5 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 2 | 10 | 3+/5+
Possessed Champion | 4 | 4 | 5 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 3 | 10 | 3+/5+
Force Organisation:
DAEMONKIN After deployment but before the first turn begins, roll a D6 for each Possessed Marine Squad. The entire squad gains the corresponding special rule for the duration of the battle: 1 — Scout 2 — Furious Charge 3 — Fleet 4 — Rending in close combat 5 — Feel No Pain (5+) 6 — Counter-Attack
• Elites
• 0–2
Allegiance:
• Traitor only
Unit Composition:
• 5 Possessed Marines
Unit Type:
• Infantry
Wargear:
• Power Armour
• Bolt pistol
• Close-combat weapon
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Word Bearers)
• Daemon
• Fearless
• Daemonkin
OPTIONS
• The squad may include up to five additional Possessed Marines for +26 points per model.
• One Possessed Marine may be upgraded to a Possessed Champion for +10 points.
• The entire squad may take:
• Frag grenades ............................ +1 point per model
• Krak grenades ........................... +2 points per model
POSSESSED CHAMPION
The Possessed Champion is a Character. The Possessed Champion may replace his Close-combat weapon with:
• Rending Weapon .................................. +5 points
• Power weapon ................................... +10 points
• Power fist ...................................... +15 points
DEDICATED TRANSPORT
The squad may select a Rhino or Dreadclaw Drop Pod where Transport Capacity permits.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
