            <characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">2+/5+</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xvii-9-zardu-layak-source" hidden="false">
          <description>Zardu Layak | 5 | 5 | 4 | 5 | 2 | 5 | 2 | 10 | 2+/5+
PSYCHIC POWERS Zardu Layak selects two powers from Malefic Daemonology and follows all normal ProHammer rules for a Mastery Level 2 Psyker. CRIMSON APOSTLE Zardu Layak counts as both a Dark Apostle and a Diabolist for all Word Bearers rules, army construction requirements and Rites of War. DARK CHANNELER When rolling on the Dark Channelling table for a unit in an army containing Zardu Layak, add +1 to the result, to a maximum of 6. REIGN OF FIRE If Zardu Layak is the army's Warlord, Ashen Circle Squads may be selected as Troops choices. They may fulfil compulsory Troops selections. ANAKATIS KUL Zardu Layak may be accompanied by the Anakatis Kul Blade-Slaves for +100 points. Zardu Layak and the Blade-Slaves count as a single HQselection.
Force Organisation:
• HQ
Allegiance:
• Traitor only
Unit Type:
• Infantry (Character)
Wargear:
• Artificer Armour
• Refractor Field
• Master-crafted Force Weapon
• Bolt pistol
• Legion Standard
• Frag grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Word Bearers)
• Independent Character
• Master of the Legion
• Daemon
• Zealot
• Psyker (Mastery Level 2\)
• Crimson Apostle
• Dark Channeler
• Reign of Fire
OPTIONS
• Zardu Layak may take:
• Krak grenades ................................ +2 points</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <selectionEntryGroups>
        <selectionEntryGroup name="Options" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xvii-9-zardu-layak-options" collective="false" import="true">
          <selectionEntries>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Krak grenades" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xvii-9-zardu-layak-opt-0-krak-grenades">
