      <rules>
        <rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xvii-10-anakatis-kul-blade-slaves-source" hidden="false">
          <description>Anakatis Kul | 5 | 4 | 6 | 5 | 3 | 5 | 3 | 8 | 3+/5+
Unit Composition:
MINDLESS KILLERS The Anakatis Kul may only be selected as part of Zardu Layak's unit. While Zardu Layak is alive, they must remain part of his unit. If Zardu Layak is slain, the surviving Blade-Slaves must declare a charge against the nearest eligible enemy unit during each Assault phase if they are able to do so. Whenever they win a close combat and an enemy unit Retreats, they must Pursue if legally able to do so.
• 2 Anakatis Kul Blade-Slaves
Unit Type:
• Infantry
Wargear:
• Power Armour
• Pair of Rending Weapons
• Plasma pistol
Special Rules:
• Daemon
• Fearless
• Furious Charge
• It Will Not Die
• Bulky
• Mindless Killers</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
    </selectionEntry>
