        <rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xviii-4-sanctifier-squad-source" hidden="false">
          <description>Sanctifier | 5 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 2 | 9 | 3+
Sanctifier Sergeant | 5 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 3 | 9 | 3+
Force Organisation:
• Elites
CLOSE-QUARTERS ARSENAL A Sanctifier equipped with two Pistol weapons has the Dual Pistols special rule. Both Pistols must fire at the same target.
Unit Composition:
• 4 Sanctifiers
• 1 Sanctifier Sergeant
Unit Type:
• Infantry
• The Sanctifier Sergeant is a Character
Wargear:
• Power Armour
• Bolter
• Bolt pistol
• Chainsword
• Frag grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Salamanders)
• Stubborn
• Close-Quarters Arsenal
OPTIONS
• The squad may include up to five additional Sanctifiers for +25 points per model.
• Any Sanctifier may replace his Bolter with:
• Second Bolt pistol ................................. Free
• Rotor Cannon .................................. +10 points
• Any Sanctifier may replace his Bolter and Bolt pistol with:
• Two Hand Flamers .............................. +10 points
• Two Volkite Serpentae ........................ +10 points
• For every five models in the squad, one Sanctifier may replace his Chainsword with:
• Rending Weapon ................................ +5 points
• Power weapon ................................. +10 points
• The entire squad may take:
• Krak grenades ............................ +2 points per model
• Melta bombs .............................. +5 points per model
SANCTIFIER SERGEANT
The Sanctifier Sergeant may replace his Chainsword with:
• Rending Weapon ................................ +5 points
• Power weapon ................................. +10 points
• Lightning claw ............................... +15 points
• Power fist .................................... +15 points
• Thunder hammer ............................... +20 points
The Sergeant may take:
• Artificer Armour ............................. +10 points
DEDICATED TRANSPORT
The squad may select a Rhino, Drop Pod, Dreadclaw Drop Pod or Land Raider where Transport Capacity permits.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
