        <rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xviii-5-artellus-numeon-source" hidden="false">
          <description>Artellus Numeon | 6 | 5 | 4 | 4 | 3 | 5 | 3 | 10 | 2+/4+
Force Organisation:
• HQ
SALAMANDERS MANTLE Numeon's Salamanders Mantle follows the normal rules presented in the Salamanders Armoury. CAPTAIN OF THE PYRE GUARD Numeon may select one Firedrake Terminator Squad as his personal retinue. One Firedrake in that unit may be upgraded to a Firedrake Master at no additional points cost. The squad does not occupy a separate Elites selection. VULKAN'S HEIR Numeon and any Salamanders unit he has joined may re-roll failed Morale tests. COMMAND RETINUE Instead of a Firedrake Terminator Squad, Numeon may select a Legion Command Squad or Legion Terminator Command Squad.
Unit Type:
• Infantry (Character)
Wargear:
• Artificer Armour
• Iron Halo
• Master-crafted Thunder hammer
• Bolt pistol
• Frag grenades
• Salamanders Mantle
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Salamanders)
• Independent Character
• Master of the Legion
• Captain of the Pyre Guard
• Vulkan's Heir
OPTIONS
• Numeon may take:
• Krak grenades ................................ +2 points
• Melta bombs ................................. +5 points</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
