    <selectionEntry type="unit" import="true" name="LORD CHAPLAIN NOMUS RHY'TAN" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xviii-6-lord-chaplain-nomus-rhy-tan">
      <costs>
        <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="205" />
      </costs>
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink id="r41-unit-xviii-6-lord-chaplain-nomus-rhy-tan-cat" name="HQ" hidden="false" targetId="cat-hq" primary="true" />
      </categoryLinks>
      <modifiers>
        <modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden">
          <conditions>
            <condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="legion-xviii" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" />
          </conditions>
        </modifier>
      </modifiers>
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="r41-unit-xviii-6-lord-chaplain-nomus-rhy-tan-unique" field="selections" scope="roster" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
      </constraints>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Nomus Rhy'tan" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xviii-6-lord-chaplain-nomus-rhy-tan-profile-0">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">6</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">10</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">2+/4+</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xviii-6-lord-chaplain-nomus-rhy-tan-source" hidden="false">
          <description>Nomus Rhy'tan | 6 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 3 | 5 | 3 | 10 | 2+/4+
MANTLE OF THE ELDER DRAKE The Mantle of the Elder Drake counts as a Salamanders Mantle. DARKSTAR FALLING Darkstar Falling is a Two-Handed, Master-crafted Power Weapon. Attacks made with it are resolved at +2 Strength and have the Concussive special rule. Against Vehicles, attacks made with Darkstar Falling have Armourbane. LORD CHAPLAIN Nomus Rhy'tan counts as a Legion Chaplain Consul for all rules, army construction requirements and Rites of War. KEEPER OF THE KEYS One Legion Dreadnought or Legion Contemptor Dreadnought may be selected as a non-compulsory HQ choice. It may not fulfil the army's compulsory HQ selection and may not be the Warlord. COMMAND RETINUE Nomus may select a Legion Command Squad, Legion Terminator Command Squad or Firedrake Terminator Squad as his retinue.
Force Organisation:
• HQ
Unit Type:
• Infantry (Character)
Wargear:
• Artificer Armour
• Iron Halo
• Darkstar Falling
• Combi-flamer
• Bolt pistol
• Frag grenades
• Mantle of the Elder Drake
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Salamanders)
• Independent Character
• Master of the Legion
• Zealot
• Lord Chaplain
• Keeper of the Keys
OPTIONS
• Nomus Rhy'tan may take:
• Krak grenades ................................ +2 points
• Melta bombs ................................. +5 points</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <selectionEntryGroups>
        <selectionEntryGroup name="Options" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xviii-6-lord-chaplain-nomus-rhy-tan-options" collective="false" import="true">
          <selectionEntries>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Krak grenades" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xviii-6-lord-chaplain-nomus-rhy-tan-opt-0-krak-grenades">
