      <rules>
        <rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xviii-9-forgefather-t-kell-source" hidden="false">
          <description>T'Kell | 5 | 5 | 4 | 4 | 2 | 5 | 2 | 10 | 2+/5+
Force Organisation:
• HQ
Unit Type:
• Infantry (Character)
Wargear:
• Artificer Armour
• Refractor Field
• Master-crafted Thunder hammer
• Bolt pistol
• Servo-Arm
• Signum
• Frag grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Salamanders)
• Independent Character
• Battlesmith
• Bolster Defences
• Master Artificer
• Keeper of the Forge
OPTIONS
• T'Kell may take:
• Krak grenades ................................ +2 points
• Melta bombs ................................. +5 points
MASTER ARTIFICER After both armies have been selected but before deployment, choose one friendly Salamanders Character. One weapon carried by that Character becomes Master-crafted for the duration of the battle. Alternatively, one friendly Salamanders Vehicle or Dreadnought may receive Extra Armour at no additional points cost. KEEPER OF THE FORGE One Salamanders Vehicle or Dreadnought eligible to purchase Reinforced Ceramite may receive that upgrade at no points cost. This may not be applied to a Land Raider or Spartan. FORGEFATHER T'Kell receives +2 rather than +1 to Battlesmith attempts for his Servo-Arm. A Battlesmith attempt may still never be improved beyond 3+.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
