      <rules>
        <rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xix-0-mor-deythan-squad-source" hidden="false">
          <description>Mor Deythan | 4 | 5 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 1 | 8 | 3+
Mor Deythan Sergeant | 4 | 5 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 2 | 9 | 3+
Force Organisation:
FATAL STRIKE Once per battle, at the beginning of the Raven Guard Shooting phase, nominate one enemy unit within 18" and line of sight of the Mor Deythan Squad. Until the end of that Shooting phase, models in the squad may re-roll To Hit rolls of 1 and To Wound rolls of 1 against the nominated enemy unit. Against Vehicles, re-roll Armour Penetration rolls of 1 instead of To Wound rolls.
• Elites
Unit Composition:
• 4 Mor Deythan
• 1 Mor Deythan Sergeant
Unit Type:
• Infantry
• Mor Deythan Sergeant is a Character
Wargear:
• Power Armour
• Sniper Rifle
• Bolt pistol
• Close-combat weapon
• Frag grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Raven Guard)
• Infiltrate
• Move Through Cover
• Fatal Strike
OPTIONS
• The squad may include up to five additional Mor Deythan for +24 points per model.
• Any model may replace its Sniper Rifle with:
• Combi-flamer ................................ +10 points
• Combi-meltagun .............................. +15 points
• Combi-plasma gun ............................ +15 points
• Combi-volkite charger ....................... +10 points
• For every five models in the squad, one Mor Deythan may replace his Sniper Rifle with:
• Heavy bolter ................................ +15 points
• Missile launcher ............................ +20 points
• The entire squad may take:
• Krak grenades ........................... +2 points per model
• Shroud Bombs ................................. +20 points
• The Mor Deythan Sergeant may select up to 50 points of permitted weapons and wargear from the Space Marine Armoury.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
