        <rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xix-8-nykona-sharrowkyn-source" hidden="false">
          <description>Nykona Sharrowkyn | 6 | 5 | 4 | 4 | 2 | 5 | 3 | 9 | 2+/5+
Nykona Sharrowkyn may replace the Sergeant or Veteran Sergeant of one Raven Guard Legion Seeker Squad or Legion
Reconnaissance Squad. Remove the normal Sergeant and include Sharrowkyn for 125 points instead.
Sharrowkyn remains part of the squad, is not an Independent Character and does not occupy a separate Force Organisation choice.
Wargear:
• Artificer Armour
• Refractor Field
• Bolt pistol
• Sniper Rifle
• Sudden Blade
• Frag grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Raven Guard)
• Infiltrate
• Move Through Cover
• Ghost in the Dark
• Perfect Ambusher
GHOST IN THE DARK While Sharrowkyn's unit is in cover, improve its Cover Save by 1, to a maximum of 3+. PERFECT AMBUSHER When Sharrowkyn shoots at an enemy unit within 12", he may re-roll failed To Hit rolls. SUDDEN BLADE Sudden Blade counts as a Master-crafted Rending Weapon.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry type="unit" import="true" name="XIX — CORVUS CORAX, THE RAVEN-LORD" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xix-9-xix-corvus-corax-the-raven-lord">
      <costs>
        <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="500" />
      </costs>
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink id="r41-unit-xix-9-xix-corvus-corax-the-raven-lord-cat" name="Lords of War" hidden="false" targetId="cat-low" primary="true" />
      </categoryLinks>
      <modifiers>
        <modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden">
          <conditions>
            <condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="legion-xix" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" />
          </conditions>
        </modifier>
        <modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden">
          <conditions>
            <condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="roster" childId="allegiance-loyalist" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" />
          </conditions>
