            <characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">7</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">6+</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Operative Leader" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xx-0-legion-operatives-profile-1">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">1</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">2</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">8</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">6+</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xx-0-legion-operatives-source" hidden="false">
          <description>Operative | 3 | 3 | 3 | 3 | 1 | 3 | 1 | 7 | 6+
Operative Leader | 3 | 3 | 3 | 3 | 1 | 3 | 2 | 8 | 6+
Force Organisation:
• Troops
Unit Composition:
• 10 Legion Operatives
Unit Type:
• Infantry
• Operative Leader is a Character
Wargear:
• Close-combat weapon
• Laspistol or Autopistol
Special Rules:
• Operative Cell
• Human Agents
OPTIONS
• The squad may include up to ten additional Operatives for +6 points per model.
• The entire squad may take:
• Frag grenades ........................... +1 point per model
• Krak grenades ........................... +1 point per model
• Melta bombs ............................. +2 points per model
• One Operative may be upgraded to an Operative Leader for +5 points.
• The Operative Leader may select up to 10 points of weapons from the Space Marine Armoury.
OPERATIVE CELL Before deployment, select one of the following skill sets for the unit at no additional points cost: - Scouts The unit gains Infiltrate and Move Through Cover. - Assassins The unit gains Infiltrate and Furious Charge. - Saboteurs The unit gains Infiltrate and Siege Specialists. HUMAN AGENTS Legion Operatives do not possess Legiones Astartes and do not benefit from Mutable Tactics or other rules which specifically affect Alpha Legion Space Marines.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
