          </conditions>
        </modifier>
      </modifiers>
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="r41-unit-xx-4-armillus-dynat-unique" field="selections" scope="roster" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
      </constraints>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Armillus Dynat" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xx-4-armillus-dynat-profile-0">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">6</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">10</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">2+/4+</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xx-4-armillus-dynat-source" hidden="false">
          <description>Armillus Dynat | 6 | 5 | 4 | 4 | 3 | 5 | 3 | 10 | 2+/4+
COMMAND SQUAD Dynat may be accompanied by a Legion Command Squad, Legion Terminator Command Squad or Lernaean Terminator Squad. Dynat and the selected squad count as a single HQ selection. THE HARROWING Dynat and any unit he has joined gain Counter-Attack. In addition, models in that unit add +1 to Armour Penetration rolls made against Vehicles in close combat. WEAPON MASTERY Dynat may divide his close-combat attacks between his Power weapon and Thunder hammer in any combination he chooses. Any bonus Attacks received for charging or fighting with two close-combat weapons may also be divided between the two weapons.
Armillus Dynat may be selected as an HQ choice in an Alpha
Legion Detachment.
Wargear:
• Artificer Armour
• Iron Halo
• Power weapon
• Thunder hammer
• Bolt pistol
• Nuncio Vox
• Frag grenades
• Krak grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Alpha Legion)
• Independent Character
• Master of the Legion
• The Harrowing
• Weapon Mastery</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
