      <rules>
        <rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xx-6-autilon-skorr-source" hidden="false">
          <description>Autilon Skorr | 5 | 5 | 4 | 4 | 3 | 5 | 3 | 10 | 2+/5+
Autilon Skorr may be selected as an HQ choice in a Traitor Alpha Legion Detachment.
Wargear:
• Artificer Armour
• Refractor Field
• Bolt pistol
• Rime-shard
• Frag grenades
• Krak grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Alpha Legion)
• Independent Character
• Master of the Legion
• Delegatus
• Desperate for Glory
DELEGATUS Autilon Skorr counts as a Legion Delegatus Consul for all rules and restrictions. DESPERATE FOR GLORY Once per battle, at the beginning of any Alpha Legion turn, Skorr may invoke Desperate for Glory. Until the beginning of the next Alpha Legion turn, Skorr and any unit he has joined gain Fearless and Feel No Pain (5+). RIME-SHARD Rime-shard counts as a Master-crafted Power Weapon. Attacks made with Rime-shard are resolved at +2 Strength. Rime-shard is Two-handed and therefore does not grant the bonus Attack for fighting with two close-combat weapons.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
    </selectionEntry>
