      <rules>
        <rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xx-7-ingo-pech-source" hidden="false">
          <description>Ingo Pech | 6 | 5 | 4 | 4 | 3 | 5 | 3 | 10 | 2+/4+
Ingo Pech may be selected as an HQ choice in an Alpha Legion Detachment.
COMMAND SQUAD Pech may be accompanied by a Legion Command Squad, Legion Terminator Command Squad, Lernaean Terminator Squad or Legion Seeker Squad. Pech and the selected squad count as a single HQ selection. MASTER OF DECEIT An army containing Ingo Pech may use The Rewards of Treachery rule presented in The Coils of the Hydra Rite of War even if the army is not using that Rite. If the army is already using The Coils of the Hydra, Ingo Pech does not permit a second Rewards of Treachery unit.
Wargear:
• Artificer Armour
• Iron Halo
• Power weapon
• Bolter
• Nuncio Vox
• Frag grenades
• Krak grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Alpha Legion)
• Independent Character
• Master of the Legion
• Master of Deceit</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
    <selectionEntryGroups><selectionEntryGroup id="live-r2-r41-unit-xx-7-ingo-pech-retinue" name="Retinue (does not occupy a separate FOC slot)" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><constraints><constraint id="live-r2-r41-unit-xx-7-ingo-pech-retinue-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><selectionEntries><selectionEntry type="unit" name="Legion Command Squad" id="live-r2-r41-unit-xx-7-ingo-pech-retinue-0-hq-centurion-ret-command" hidden="false" import="true">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="live-r2-r41-unit-xx-7-ingo-pech-retinue-0-hq-centurion-ret-command-max" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" />
              </constraints>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="90" />
              </costs>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Standard Wargear" id="live-r2-r41-unit-xx-7-ingo-pech-retinue-0-hq-centurion-ret-command-std" hidden="false">
                  <description>Five Legion Veterans, each equipped with Power Armour, Bolt Pistol, Chainsword and Frag Grenades.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule name="Legiones Astartes" id="live-r2-r41-unit-xx-7-ingo-pech-retinue-0-hq-centurion-ret-command-la" hidden="false">
                  <description>Every model has Legiones Astartes and And They Shall Know No Fear as presented in ProHammer Classic, and is not Fearless.</description>
                </rule>
