      <rules>
        <rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xx-8-mathias-herzog-source" hidden="false">
          <description>Mathias Herzog | 6 | 5 | 4 | 4 | 3 | 5 | 3 | 10 | 2+/4+
Mathias Herzog may be selected as an HQ choice in an Alpha Legion Detachment.
FALSE DISPOSITION After both armies have deployed but before determining which player takes the first turn, nominate Herzog and one other friendly non-Vehicle Alpha Legion unit. Both units may immediately be redeployed anywhere wholly within the Alpha Legion deployment zone. Units placed in Reserve or using Infiltrate are not eligible. HEADHUNTER COMMANDER One Headhunter Kill Team may be selected without occupying an Elites choice in an army containing Mathias Herzog. That unit remains an Elites unit for all other purposes.
Wargear:
• Artificer Armour
• Iron Halo
• Bolter with Banestrike Ammunition
• Bolt pistol
• Power weapon
• Frag grenades
• Krak grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Alpha Legion)
• Independent Character
• Master of the Legion
• False Disposition
• Headhunter Commander</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
    </selectionEntry>
