        <rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xx-9-sheed-ranko-source" hidden="false">
          <description>Sheed Ranko | 5 | 5 | 4 | 4 | 2 | 4 | 3 | 9 | 2+/4+
Sheed Ranko may replace one model in a Lernaean Terminator Squad. His total cost is 110 points, meaning the upgrade costs +62 points in addition to the replaced Lernaean Terminator. Ranko remains part of the squad, is not an Independent Character and does not occupy a separate Force Organisation choice.
HYDRA'S RESILIENCE While Sheed Ranko remains alive, his Lernaean Terminator Squad has the Stubborn special rule.
Wargear:
• Cataphractii Terminator Armour
• Combi-plasma gun
• Two Power weapons
• Auspex
• Nuncio Vox
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Alpha Legion)
• Hydra's Resilience</description>
        </rule>
