      <rules>
        <rule name="Source Entry" id="r42-role-iii-1-effects-chosen-of-vairosean-kakophoni-squads-r41-unit-iii-2-kakophoni-squad-source" hidden="false">
          <description>Kakophoni | 4 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 5 | 1 | 10 | 3+
Cacophonic Champion | 4 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 5 | 2 | 10 | 3+
Force Organisation:
• Heavy Support
CACOPHONY If an enemy unit suffers one or more casualties from shooting attacks made by a Kakophoni Squad, it must take a Pinning test after the squad has finished firing.
Unit Composition:
• 5 Kakophoni
• 1 Cacophonic Champion
Unit Type:
• Infantry
• The Cacophonic Champion is a Character
Wargear:
• Power Armour
• Sonic Blaster
• Frag grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Emperor's Children)
• Fearless
• Cacophony
Restriction:
• Traitor armies only
OPTIONS
• The squad may include up to six additional Kakophoni
for +25 points per model.
• For every three models in the squad, one Kakophoni may replace his Sonic Blaster with:
• Blastmaster .................................. +15 points
• The Cacophonic Champion may replace his Sonic Blaster with:
• Doom Siren and bolt pistol .................. Free
• The entire squad may take:
• Krak grenades .............................. +2 points per model
• The Cacophonic Champion may take:
• Power weapon ................................. +10 points
• Power fist ................................... +15 points
• Melta bombs .................................. +5 points
DEDICATED TRANSPORT
A squad of ten models or fewer may select a Rhino, Drop Pod or Land Raider where Transport Capacity permits.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="r42-role-iii-1-effects-chosen-of-vairosean-kakophoni-squads-rite-note" name="Rite of War Interaction" hidden="false">
          <description>TRAITOR ONLY
As the III Legion descended into corruption, entire formations embraced the experimental sonic augmentations first developed amongst the Kakophoni. The most infamous of these formations was the 3rd Company, whose warriors willingly submitted themselves to increasingly extreme surgical and sonic modification.
EFFECTS
CHOSEN OF VAIROSEAN
Kakophoni Squads may be selected as Troops choices. Kakophoni Squads selected as Troops may fulfil compulsory Troops selections.
All Kakophoni Squads in the Detachment gain the Relentless special rule.
SONIC ASSAULT
Any Emperor's Children Infantry unit composed entirely of models wearing Power Armour or Artificer Armour may purchase Sonic Shriekers for +2 points per model. Every eligible model in the unit must purchase the upgrade.
A unit equipped in this manner follows the normal Sonic Shrieker rules.
ARMOURY OF EXCESS
The normal restriction allowing only one Legion Heavy Support Squad to select Sonic Weaponry is removed.
Up to two Legion Heavy Support Squads may select Sonic Weaponry when using this Rite of War.
PERFECT CACOPHONY
A unit in which every surviving model is equipped with either a Sonic Weapon or Sonic Shrieker gains the Fear special rule.
LIMITATIONS
This Rite of War may only be selected by a Traitor Emperor's Children Detachment.
The army must include at least one Kakophoni Squad.
The army's Warlord must either:
• be equipped with a Sonic Shrieker; or
• be a named Character whose rules specifically associate him with the Kakophoni or 3rd Company.
The army may include no more than one Fortification.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="r42-role-iii-1-effects-chosen-of-vairosean-kakophoni-squads-clone-cleanup" name="Builder compatibility" hidden="false">
