    <selectionEntry type="unit" import="true" name="Legion Veteran Squad" hidden="true" id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-veteran-unit">
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-veteran-unit-cat" name="Troops" hidden="false" targetId="cat-troops" primary="true" />
      </categoryLinks>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Standard Wargear" id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-veteran-standard" hidden="false">
          <description>Every model is equipped with Power Armour, a Bolter, Bolt Pistol, Chainsword and Frag Grenades unless replaced by an option below.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Legiones Astartes" id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-veteran-legiones" hidden="false">
          <description>All models have the Legiones Astartes special rule and And They Shall Know No Fear as presented in ProHammer Classic. They are not Fearless.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Veteran Tactics" id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-veteran-tactics-rule" hidden="false">
          <description>When constructing the army, select one Veteran Tactic for this squad. The chosen ability applies to every model in the squad for the duration of the battle.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Dedicated Transport" id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-veteran-transport-rule" hidden="false">
          <description>If not equipped with Jump Packs, the squad may select a Rhino, Drop Pod, Dreadclaw Drop Pod or Land Raider where permitted. Land Raider choices will become selectable when their vehicle entries are added; the rule remains in force now.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-rite-note" name="Rite of War Interaction" hidden="false">
          <description>The Reaping is one of the characteristic attack formations of the XIV Legion. Heavy infantry and fire-support units advance in a relentless column, purging shattered cities and fortified battlefields through weight of fire and remorseless attrition.
EFFECTS
SUPERIOR FIREPOWER
Legion Veteran Squads and Legion Heavy Support Squads may be selected as non-compulsory Troops choices.
They may not fulfil compulsory Troops selections unless another rule specifically permits them to do so.
IMPLACABLE
All Death Guard Infantry units gain the Move Through Cover special rule.
This includes models wearing any form of Terminator Armour.
DARK ARSENAL
Any Death Guard Character or Independent Character may purchase Rad Grenades for +10 points.
Rad Grenades follow the normal rules presented in the Legiones Astartes Army List.
LIMITATIONS
Units in the Detachment may not make Advance Moves.
Vehicles in the Detachment may not move Flat Out.
Units in the Detachment may not deploy using Deep Strike. Units which are required to deploy using Deep Strike may not be selected.
The normal Death Guard restriction on Fast Attack choices from Footslogging Killers continues to apply.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="r42-role-xiv-0-effects-superior-firepower-legion-veteran-squads-clone-cleanup" name="Builder compatibility" hidden="false">
          <description>Removed 3 obsolete armoury link(s) inherited from the generic source entry while creating this Rite-specific battlefield-role copy.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
