        <profile name="Palatine Primus" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false" id="r46-al-reward-0-r41-unit-iii-0-palatine-blade-squad-profile-1">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">1</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">9</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">2+</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Source Entry" id="r46-al-reward-0-r41-unit-iii-0-palatine-blade-squad-source" hidden="false">
          <description>Palatine Blade | 5 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 2 | 9 | 2+
Palatine Primus | 5 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 5 | 3 | 9 | 2+
Force Organisation:
DUELISTS When fighting an enemy unit containing one or more Characters or Independent Characters, models in this squad may re-roll close-combat To Hit rolls of 1.
• Elites
Unit Composition:
• 4 Palatine Blades
• 1 Palatine Primus
Unit Type:
• Infantry
• The Palatine Primus is a Character
Wargear:
• Artificer Armour
• Bolt pistol
• Rending Weapon
• Frag grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Emperor's Children)
• Duelists
OPTIONS
• The squad may include up to five additional Palatine Blades
for +30 points per model.
• Any model may replace its Rending Weapon with:
• Power weapon ................................. +10 points
• Any model may take:
• Combat Shield ................................ +5 points
• Melta bombs .................................. +5 points
• The Palatine Primus may select up to 50 points of additional
permitted weapons and wargear from the Space Marine Armoury.
• The entire squad may take:
• Krak grenades .............................. +2 points per model
JUMP PACKS
The entire squad may be equipped with Jump Packs for +15 points per model. If equipped with Jump Packs, the unit becomes Jump Infantry and follows the normal ProHammer rules for Jump Infantry. It may not select a Dedicated Transport.
DEDICATED TRANSPORT
A squad without Jump Packs may select a Rhino, Drop Pod, Dreadclaw Drop Pod or Land Raider where Transport Capacity permits.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="r46-al-reward-0-rule" name="The Rewards of Treachery" hidden="false">
          <description>One eligible Legion-specific unit from another Legion may be selected as an Elites choice. It retains its profile, equipment, options and unit-specific special rules, but replaces its original Legion-specific Legiones Astartes rules with Legiones Astartes (Alpha Legion) and benefits from Alpha Legion rules including Mutable Tactics.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <selectionEntries>
        <selectionEntry type="model" import="true" name="Squad Models" hidden="false" id="r46-al-reward-0-r41-unit-iii-0-palatine-blade-squad-additional" defaultAmount="5">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="r46-al-reward-0-r41-unit-iii-0-palatine-blade-squad-additional-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="10" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
            <constraint id="r46-al-reward-0-r41-unit-iii-0-palatine-blade-squad-additional-min-total" type="min" value="5" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" />
          </constraints>
          <costs>
            <cost name="Points" typeId="pts" value="30" />
          </costs>
        </selectionEntry>
      </selectionEntries>
      <selectionEntryGroups>
        <selectionEntryGroup name="Options" hidden="false" id="r46-al-reward-0-r41-unit-iii-0-palatine-blade-squad-options" collective="false" import="true">
          <selectionEntries>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="for" hidden="false" id="r46-al-reward-0-r41-unit-iii-0-palatine-blade-squad-opt-0-for">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="r46-al-reward-0-r41-unit-iii-0-palatine-blade-squad-opt-0-for-max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" type="max" />
              </constraints>
              <costs>
