        <rule name="Source Entry" id="r46-al-reward-1-r41-unit-iii-1-phoenix-terminator-squad-source" hidden="false">
          <description>Phoenix Terminator | 5 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 5 | 2 | 9 | 2+/5+
Phoenix Champion | 5 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 5 | 3 | 10 | 2+/5+
Force Organisation:
• Elites
Unit Composition:
• 4 Phoenix Terminators
• 1 Phoenix Champion
Unit Type:
• Infantry
• The Phoenix Champion is a Character
Wargear:
• Tartaros Terminator Armour
• Phoenix Spear
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Emperor's Children)
• Implacable Advance
• Stubborn
OPTIONS
• The squad may include up to five additional Phoenix Terminators
for +45 points per model.
• One Phoenix Terminator may take:
• Doom Siren ................................... +15 points
• The Phoenix Champion may take:
• Grenade Harness .............................. +10 points
DEDICATED TRANSPORT
The squad may select a Land Raider, Dreadclaw Drop Pod or Spartan Assault Tank where Transport Capacity permits.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="r46-al-reward-1-rule" name="The Rewards of Treachery" hidden="false">
          <description>One eligible Legion-specific unit from another Legion may be selected as an Elites choice. It retains its profile, equipment, options and unit-specific special rules, but replaces its original Legion-specific Legiones Astartes rules with Legiones Astartes (Alpha Legion) and benefits from Alpha Legion rules including Mutable Tactics.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
