      <rules>
        <rule name="Source Entry" id="r46-al-reward-3-r41-unit-iii-3-sun-killer-squad-source" hidden="false">
          <description>Sun Killer | 4 | 5 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 1 | 9 | 3+
Sun Killer Prefector | 4 | 5 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 2 | 10 | 3+
Force Organisation:
EXEMPLARY MARKSMEN Once during each friendly Shooting phase, the Sun Killer Squad may re-roll one failed shooting To Hit roll. The second result must be accepted.
• Heavy Support
Unit Composition:
• 4 Sun Killers
• 1 Sun Killer Prefector
Unit Type:
• Infantry
• The Sun Killer Prefector is a Character
Wargear:
• Power Armour
• Lascannon
• Bolt pistol
• Frag grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Emperor's Children)
• Exemplary Marksmen
OPTIONS
• The squad may include up to five additional Sun Killers
for +50 points per model.
ENERGY WEAPONS
The entire squad may replace all of its Lascannons with one of the following:
• Plasma Cannons ................................. -5 points per model
• Volkite Culverins .............................. -15 points per model
Every model in the squad must carry the same Heavy weapon.
• The entire squad may take:
• Krak grenades .............................. +2 points per model
• The Sun Killer Prefector may take:
• Artificer Armour ............................. +10 points
• Melta bombs .................................. +5 points
DEDICATED TRANSPORT
The squad may select a Rhino as a Dedicated Transport.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="r46-al-reward-3-rule" name="The Rewards of Treachery" hidden="false">
          <description>One eligible Legion-specific unit from another Legion may be selected as an Elites choice. It retains its profile, equipment, options and unit-specific special rules, but replaces its original Legion-specific Legiones Astartes rules with Legiones Astartes (Alpha Legion) and benefits from Alpha Legion rules including Mutable Tactics.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
