      <rules>
        <rule name="Source Entry" id="r46-al-reward-4-r41-unit-iv-0-tyrant-siege-terminator-squad-source" hidden="false">
          <description>Tyrant Siege Terminator | 4 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 3 | 2 | 9 | 2+/4+
Tyrant Siege Master | 4 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 3 | 3 | 9 | 2+/4+
COORDINATED BOMBARDMENT When the squad fires its Cyclone Missile Launchers, it may re-roll one failed To Hit roll made with a Cyclone Missile Launcher during that Shooting phase. A model equipped with a Cyclone Missile Launcher may fire it in addition to its Storm bolter or Foeblaster boltgun during the same Shooting phase. Both weapons must target the same enemy unit.
Force Organisation:
• Heavy Support
Unit Composition:
• 4 Tyrant Siege Terminators
• 1 Tyrant Siege Master
Unit Type:
• Infantry
• The Tyrant Siege Master is a Character
Wargear:
• Cataphractii Terminator Armour
• Storm bolter
• Power weapon
• Cyclone Missile Launcher
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Iron Warriors)
• Coordinated Bombardment
OPTIONS
• The squad may include up to five additional Tyrant Siege Terminators
for +65 points per model.
• Any model may replace its Storm bolter with:
• Foeblaster boltgun ............................. +5 points
• Any model may replace its Power weapon with:
• Power fist ..................................... +5 points
• Chainfist ...................................... +10 points
• The Tyrant Siege Master may take:
• Grenade Harness ................................ +10 points
DEDICATED TRANSPORT
The squad may select a Land Raider, Dreadclaw Drop Pod or Spartan Assault Tank where Transport Capacity permits</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="r46-al-reward-4-rule" name="The Rewards of Treachery" hidden="false">
          <description>One eligible Legion-specific unit from another Legion may be selected as an Elites choice. It retains its profile, equipment, options and unit-specific special rules, but replaces its original Legion-specific Legiones Astartes rules with Legiones Astartes (Alpha Legion) and benefits from Alpha Legion rules including Mutable Tactics.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
