            <characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">3+/5+</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Source Entry" id="r46-al-reward-7-r41-unit-iv-3-iron-circle-domitar-ferrum-maniple-source" hidden="false">
          <description>Domitar-Ferrum | 4 | 4 | 7 | 7 | 4 | 3 | 3 | 8 | 3+/5+
Force Organisation:
• Elites
Unit Composition:
• 1 Domitar-Ferrum
Unit Type:
• Monstrous Creature
Wargear:
• Olympia-pattern Bolt Cannon
• Graviton Maul
• Karceri Battle Shield
Special Rules:
• Cybernetica Cortex
• Reactor Blast
• Crusader
• Moving Bulwark
• Iron Warriors Construct
OPTIONS
• The maniple may include up to five additional Domitar-Ferrum
for +205 points per model.
MOVING BULWARK If a Domitar-Ferrum is in base contact with another friendly Domitar-Ferrum from the same unit, both models improve their Invulnerable Save from 5+ to 4+. The bonus is lost as soon as the models are no longer in base contact. IRON WARRIORS CONSTRUCT The Iron Circle counts as an Iron Warriors unit for rules which specifically affect friendly Iron Warriors units. It does not possess the Legiones Astartes special rule. KARCERI BATTLE SHIELD The Karceri Battle Shield grants the Domitar-Ferrum its 5+ Invulnerable Save. This is already included in its profile. GRAVITON MAUL The Graviton Maul is a Power Weapon. Attacks made with it are resolved at Strength 10 and have the Concussive special rule. Weapon Range S AP Type Olympia-pattern Bolt Cannon 36" 5 4 Heavy 5, Pinning</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="r46-al-reward-7-rule" name="The Rewards of Treachery" hidden="false">
          <description>One eligible Legion-specific unit from another Legion may be selected as an Elites choice. It retains its profile, equipment, options and unit-specific special rules, but replaces its original Legion-specific Legiones Astartes rules with Legiones Astartes (Alpha Legion) and benefits from Alpha Legion rules including Mutable Tactics.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <selectionEntries>
        <selectionEntry type="model" import="true" name="Squad Models" hidden="false" id="r46-al-reward-7-r41-unit-iv-3-iron-circle-domitar-ferrum-maniple-additional" defaultAmount="1">
