          <description>Golden Keshig | 5 | 4 | 4 | 5 | 1 | 4 | 2 | 9 | 2+
Golden Keshig Champion | 5 | 4 | 4 | 5 | 1 | 4 | 3 | 10 | 2+
Force Organisation:
• Fast Attack
Unit Composition:
• 2 Golden Keshig
• 1 Golden Keshig Champion
Unit Type:
• Jetbikes
• The Golden Keshig Champion is a Character
Wargear:
• Power Armour
• Scimitar Jetbike with Heavy Bolter and Hellfire Rounds
• Bolt pistol
• Chogorian Warlance
• Frag grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (White Scars)
• Deep Strike
OPTIONS
• The squadron may include up to two additional Golden Keshig
for +55 points per model.
• The entire squadron may take:
• Krak grenades ................................. +2 points per model
• Melta bombs .................................. +5 points per model
JETBIKE WEAPONS
For every three models in the squadron, one Golden Keshig may
replace the Heavy Bolter with Hellfire Rounds mounted on his Jetbike with:
• Multi-Melta ..................................... +10 points
• Volkite Culverin ................................ +10 points</description>
        </rule>
