      <rules>
        <rule name="Source Entry" id="r46-al-reward-19-r41-unit-viii-1-night-raptor-squad-source" hidden="false">
          <description>Night Raptor | 4 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 1 | 8 | 3+
Raptor Sergeant | 4 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 2 | 9 | 3+
Headtaker | 5 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 2 | 9 | 3+
Force Organisation:
• Fast Attack
Unit Composition:
• 4 Night Raptors
• 1 Raptor Sergeant
Unit Type:
• Jump Infantry
• The Raptor Sergeant is a Character
Wargear:
• Power Armour
• Jump Pack
• Bolt pistol
• Chainsword
• Frag grenades
• Trophies of Judgement
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Night Lords)
• Hit &amp; Run
OPTIONS
• The squad may include up to ten additional Night Raptors
for +28 points per model.
• Up to five models may replace their Chainsword with:
• Rending Weapon ................................ +5 points
• Power weapon ................................. +10 points
• Up to two Night Raptors may replace their Bolt pistol with:
• Volkite Serpenta .............................. +5 points
• Hand Flamer ................................... +5 points
• Plasma Pistol ................................ +15 points
• Up to two models may take:
• Melta bombs .................................... +5 points
• The entire squad may take:
• Krak grenades ............................ +2 points per model
• Stealth Adept ............................ +1 point per model
HEADTAKER
The Raptor Sergeant may be upgraded to a Headtaker for +15 points. A Headtaker has Weapon Skill 5.
The Headtaker may select up to 50 points of permitted weapons and wargear from the Space Marine Armoury and Night Lords Armoury</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="r46-al-reward-19-rule" name="The Rewards of Treachery" hidden="false">
          <description>One eligible Legion-specific unit from another Legion may be selected as an Elites choice. It retains its profile, equipment, options and unit-specific special rules, but replaces its original Legion-specific Legiones Astartes rules with Legiones Astartes (Alpha Legion) and benefits from Alpha Legion rules including Mutable Tactics.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
