      <rules>
        <rule name="Source Entry" id="r46-al-reward-21-r41-unit-ix-0-dawnbreaker-cohort-source" hidden="false">
          <description>Dawnbreaker | 5 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 2 | 9 | 2+
Dawnbreaker Champion | 5 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 3 | 10 | 2+
Force Organisation:
FALLING-STAR SPEAR A Falling-star Spear is a Two-Handed Power Weapon. Attacks made with it are resolved at +1 Strength. EQUINOX BLADES Equinox Blades count as a pair of Power Weapons. Grenade Discharger Weapon Range S AP Type Frag Grenade 12" 3 6 Assault 1, Blast Krak Grenade 12" 6 4 Assault 1
• Elites
Unit Composition:
• 4 Dawnbreakers
• 1 Dawnbreaker Champion
Unit Type:
• Jump Infantry
• The Dawnbreaker Champion is a Character
Wargear:
• Artificer Armour
• Jump Pack
• Falling-star Spear
• Grenade Discharger
• Frag grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Blood Angels)
• Hammer of Wrath
OPTIONS
• The squad may include up to five additional Dawnbreakers for +35 points per model.
• Any model may replace his Falling-star Spear with:
• Pair of Equinox Blades .............................. Free
• The entire squad may take:
• Krak grenades ............................ +2 points per model
• Melta bombs .............................. +5 points per model
DAWNBREAKER CHAMPION
The Dawnbreaker Champion may select up to 50 points of permitted weapons and wargear from the Space Marine Armoury.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="r46-al-reward-21-rule" name="The Rewards of Treachery" hidden="false">
          <description>One eligible Legion-specific unit from another Legion may be selected as an Elites choice. It retains its profile, equipment, options and unit-specific special rules, but replaces its original Legion-specific Legiones Astartes rules with Legiones Astartes (Alpha Legion) and benefits from Alpha Legion rules including Mutable Tactics.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
