      <profiles>
        <profile name="Justaerin Terminator" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false" id="r46-al-reward-46-r41-unit-xvi-0-justaerin-terminator-squad-profile-0">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">2</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">2</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">9</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">2+/4+</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Source Entry" id="r46-al-reward-46-r41-unit-xvi-0-justaerin-terminator-squad-source" hidden="false">
          <description>Justaerin Terminator | 5 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 2 | 3 | 2 | 9 | 2+/4+
Force Organisation:
CHOSEN OF THE WARMASTER A Sons of Horus Praetor, Ezekyle Abaddon or Horus Lupercal may select one Justaerin Terminator Squad as a retinue. If selected as a retinue, the squad does not occupy a separate Elites choice.
• Elites
• 0–1
Unit Composition:
• 5 Justaerin Terminators
Unit Type:
• Infantry
Wargear:
• Cataphractii Terminator Armour
• Foeblaster Boltgun
• Power weapon or Power fist
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Sons of Horus)
• Chosen of the Warmaster
OPTIONS
• The squad may include up to five additional Justaerin Terminators for +57 points per model.
• Any model equipped with a Power fist may replace it with:
• Chainfist ....................................... +5 points
• Any model may replace his Foeblaster Boltgun with:
• Combi-flamer .................................. +10 points
• Combi-volkite charger ........................ +10 points
• Combi-meltagun ............................... +15 points
• Combi-plasma gun ............................. +15 points
• Any model may replace both of his weapons with:
• Pair of Lightning Claws ....................... Free
• For every five models, up to two Justaerin may replace their Foeblaster Boltgun with:
• Heavy Flamer .................................. +10 points
• Reaper Autocannon ............................ +20 points
• Multi-Melta ................................... +25 points
• The squad may purchase:
• Banestrike Ammunition .................... +2 points per
eligible model
• Teleportation Transponders ................... +15 points
• One Justaerin may be upgraded to Falkus Kibre as described in his entry.
DEDICATED TRANSPORT
The squad may select a Land Raider, Dreadclaw Drop Pod or Spartan Assault Tank where Transport Capacity permits.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="r46-al-reward-46-rule" name="The Rewards of Treachery" hidden="false">
          <description>One eligible Legion-specific unit from another Legion may be selected as an Elites choice. It retains its profile, equipment, options and unit-specific special rules, but replaces its original Legion-specific Legiones Astartes rules with Legiones Astartes (Alpha Legion) and benefits from Alpha Legion rules including Mutable Tactics.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
