        <profile name="Reaver Chieftain" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false" id="r46-al-reward-47-r41-unit-xvi-1-reaver-attack-squad-profile-1">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">1</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">2</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">9</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">3+</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Source Entry" id="r46-al-reward-47-r41-unit-xvi-1-reaver-attack-squad-source" hidden="false">
          <description>Reaver | 4 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 1 | 9 | 3+
Reaver Chieftain | 4 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 2 | 9 | 3+
Force Organisation:
• Fast Attack
Unit Composition:
• 4 Reavers
• 1 Reaver Chieftain
Unit Type:
• Infantry
• The Reaver Chieftain is a Character
Wargear:
• Power Armour
• Bolt pistol
• Chainaxe
• Frag grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Sons of Horus)
• Furious Charge
OPTIONS
• The squad may include up to five additional Reavers for +22 points per model.
• Up to two Reavers may replace their Bolt pistol with:
• Flamer .......................................... +5 points
• Meltagun ....................................... +10 points
• Plasma Gun ..................................... +15 points
• Plasma Pistol .................................. +15 points
• For every five models in the squad, one Reaver may:
• Replace his Chainaxe with a Power fist ......... +15 points
• Replace his Bolt pistol and Chainaxe with
a pair of Lightning Claws ....................... +15 points
• Every model other than the Reaver Chieftain may purchase:
• Terminator Honours ............................. +15 points
• The entire squad may take:
• Krak grenades ............................ +2 points per model
• Melta bombs .............................. +5 points per model
JUMP ASSAULT
The entire squad may purchase Jump Packs for +15 points per model.
If equipped with Jump Packs:
• the unit becomes Jump Infantry;
• it follows the normal ProHammer Jump Infantry rules;
• it may not select a Dedicated Transport.
REAVER CHIEFTAIN
The Reaver Chieftain may select up to 50 points of permitted weapons and wargear from the Space Marine Armoury and Sons of Horus Armoury.
DEDICATED TRANSPORT
A squad without Jump Packs may select a Rhino, Drop Pod, Dreadclaw Drop Pod or Land Raider where Transport Capacity permits.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="r46-al-reward-47-rule" name="The Rewards of Treachery" hidden="false">
          <description>One eligible Legion-specific unit from another Legion may be selected as an Elites choice. It retains its profile, equipment, options and unit-specific special rules, but replaces its original Legion-specific Legiones Astartes rules with Legiones Astartes (Alpha Legion) and benefits from Alpha Legion rules including Mutable Tactics.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
