          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Chieftain Prime" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false" id="r46-al-reward-48-r41-unit-xvi-2-chieftain-squad-profile-1">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">2</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">10</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">3+/5+</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Source Entry" id="r46-al-reward-48-r41-unit-xvi-2-chieftain-squad-source" hidden="false">
          <description>Chieftain | 5 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 2 | 4 | 2 | 9 | 3+/5+
Chieftain Prime | 5 | 4 | 4 | 4 | 2 | 4 | 3 | 10 | 3+/5+
Force Organisation:
• Elites
• 0–1
CTHONIAN RETINUE One Chieftain Squad may be selected as the retinue of a Sons of Horus Praetor or appropriate named Sons of Horus Independent Character. The squad does not occupy a separate Elites choice. The Character and Chieftain Squad count as a single HQ selection.
Unit Composition:
• 4 Chieftains
• 1 Chieftain Prime
Unit Type:
• Infantry
• The Chieftain Prime is a Character
Wargear:
• Power Armour
• Boarding Shield
• Bolter
• Cthonian Culling Blade
• Frag grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Sons of Horus)
• Stubborn
• Cthonian Retinue
OPTIONS
• The squad may include up to five additional Chieftains for +40 points per model.
• Any model may replace his Cthonian Culling Blade with:
• Power weapon ................................... +5 points
• Power fist .................................... +10 points
• Lightning claw ............................... +10 points
• Thunder hammer ............................... +15 points
• Any model may replace his Bolter with:
• Foeblaster Boltgun ............................. +5 points
• Combi-flamer .................................. +10 points
• Combi-volkite charger ........................ +10 points
• Combi-meltagun ............................... +15 points
• Combi-plasma gun ............................. +15 points
• The entire squad may take:
• Krak grenades ............................ +2 points per model
• Melta bombs .............................. +5 points per model
DEDICATED TRANSPORT
The squad may select a Rhino, Dreadclaw Drop Pod or Land Raider where Transport Capacity permits.
CHIEFTAIN PRIME
The Chieftain Prime may select up to 50 points of permitted weapons and wargear from the Space Marine Armoury and Sons of Horus Armoury.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="r46-al-reward-48-rule" name="The Rewards of Treachery" hidden="false">
          <description>One eligible Legion-specific unit from another Legion may be selected as an Elites choice. It retains its profile, equipment, options and unit-specific special rules, but replaces its original Legion-specific Legiones Astartes rules with Legiones Astartes (Alpha Legion) and benefits from Alpha Legion rules including Mutable Tactics.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
