      <rules>
        <rule name="Source Entry" id="r46-al-reward-61-r41-unit-xix-3-raptor-squad-source" hidden="false">
          <description>Raptor | 4 | 4 | 5 | 4 | 1 | 5 | 2 | 8 | 3+
Raptor Alpha | 4 | 4 | 5 | 4 | 1 | 5 | 3 | 9 | 3+
UNSTABLE CREATION Raptors may never fulfil compulsory Troops selections and may not be joined by an Independent Character other than Corax or Branne Nev.
Force Organisation:
• Elites
• 0–1
Restriction:
• Loyalist only
Unit Composition:
• 4 Raptors
• 1 Raptor Alpha
Unit Type:
• Infantry
• Raptor Alpha is a Character
Wargear:
• Power Armour
• Bolt pistol
• Close-combat weapon
• Frag grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Raven Guard)
• Fleet
• Furious Charge
• Move Through Cover
• Rending — close combat attacks only
• Unstable Creation
OPTIONS
• The squad may include up to five additional Raptors for +32 points per model.
• The entire squad may take:
• Krak grenades ........................... +2 points per model
• Melta bombs ............................. +5 points per model
• For every five models, one Raptor may replace his Bolt pistol with:
• Hand flamer ................................... +5 points
• Plasma pistol ................................ +15 points
• The Raptor Alpha may select up to 50 points of permitted weapons and wargear from the Space Marine Armoury.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="r46-al-reward-61-rule" name="The Rewards of Treachery" hidden="false">
          <description>One eligible Legion-specific unit from another Legion may be selected as an Elites choice. It retains its profile, equipment, options and unit-specific special rules, but replaces its original Legion-specific Legiones Astartes rules with Legiones Astartes (Alpha Legion) and benefits from Alpha Legion rules including Mutable Tactics.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <selectionEntries>
        <selectionEntry type="model" import="true" name="Squad Models" hidden="false" id="r46-al-reward-61-r41-unit-xix-3-raptor-squad-additional" defaultAmount="5">
